        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>家庭净水器选购指南</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #e8443c;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #e8443c;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 14px 0 0 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #fdf6f0;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 0 14px;\n    padding: 22px 24px 34px 24px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #e8443c;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #e8443c;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #f19aa0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #f3b9b6;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 22px 0 12px 0;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 6px; }\n  .check {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 19px;\n    height: 19px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ffc627;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 19px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    vertical-align: 2px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin: 16px 0 4px 0;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n  }\n  table tr:first-child {\n    background: #6b7280;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  table tr:last-child {\n    background: #e5e7eb;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  table td {\n    padding: 9px 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  table td:first-child {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    width: 84px;\n  }\n  .bottom-bar {\n    height: 26px;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">家庭净水器选购指南</div>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">@吃货万万岁</div>\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <h2><span class=\"check\">✓</span>1.选RO反渗透净水器，别选超滤净水器</h2>\n    <p>超滤膜过滤精度只有0.01微米，而RO膜是0.0001微米。差距是100倍！所以一定要选RO反渗透！</p>\n\n    <h2><span class=\"check\">✓</span>2.通量选大于800G的</h2>\n    <p>通量决定了出水速度，出水速度大后，净水器就不光可以饮水，还可以洗碗、洗水果、煲汤等</p>\n\n    <table>\n      <tr>\n        <td>通量</td>\n        <td>400G</td>\n        <td>600G</td>\n        <td>800G</td>\n        <td>1000G</td>\n        <td>1200G</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>出水速度</td>\n        <td>1L/min</td>\n        <td>1.5L/min</td>\n        <td>2L/min</td>\n        <td>2.5L/min</td>\n        <td>3L/min</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <h2><span class=\"check\">✓</span>3.最好选0添加0阻垢剂0陈水的</h2>\n    <p>阻垢剂并不能增强滤芯的过滤性能，也不能改善纯水的水质。同时，阻垢剂中的含磷物质还会造成水体营养化，所以尽量选择0阻垢剂的净水器；0陈水的意思，就是不会储水。这样我们就不会喝 到隔夜水了～每天清晨的第一杯水不需要倒掉。</p>\n\n    <h2><span class=\"check\">✓</span>4.空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶</h2>\n    <p>净水器有桶无桶其实都可以！有桶也不会造成细菌污染（都是无桶商家踩出来的）。所以，你根据实际场景选！空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-bar\"></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
